{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>相信沒有人能抵擋名古屋炭火燒鰻魚的魅力，濃郁醬汁滴在燒到紅透的備長炭上，微焦香氣真的會讓人停下腳步！今次精選10間名古屋市內的Tabelog高分鰻魚店，每間都是在地人吃過返尋味的存在呢～</p><p>🩵留言「nagoya」Send餐廳資料 &amp; 訂座連結給你～</p><p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151844135163818_1972236346ac866e97a935.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151844284428397_3344924106ac866eaf2ae2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151844411784308_8593145606ac866ec3d50a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151844528193926_12053404966ac866ee2708e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151844705641642_14737849436ac866ef64eb0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151844828261230_13480009716ac866f06f7c3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151844935540873_21161164246ac866f17546a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179151845056924199_1953527796ac866f2d8b2c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p><p>Tags : IG精選 名古屋美食 名古屋鰻魚飯 為食榜</p><p>圖片來源：@tabelog_japanbylocals / 官方 資料或影片來源： Gotrip IG</p><p>Oct 9 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T04:18:27.821424+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}